OL,3,GNEWSAWhat festive events are taking    
OL,4,Aplace in Bradford?                     
OL,6,FAs Christmas approaches, Bradford is   
OL,7,Fgearing up for an eclectic mix of      
OL,8,Ffestive events across the district,    
OL,9,Fincluding cheese and wine tasting, a   
OL,10,Fliving nativity barn and an            
OL,11,FAfro-Caribbean Christmas Market.       
OL,13,FThe programme includes live            
OL,14,Fentertainment, seasonal markets,       
OL,15,Fcreative activities and traditional    
OL,16,Fcelebrations.                          
OL,18,FDarley Street Market will host an East 
OL,19,FAsian Christmas Market inspired by     
OL,20,FJapan, South Korea, China and Hong Kong
OL,21,Fon 5 December and an Afro-Caribbean    
OL,22,FChristmas Market on 19 December.       
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
