OL,3,GNEWSAWhat festive events are taking    
OL,4,Aplace in Bradford?                     
OL,6,FMeanwhile in Centenary Square, Bradford
OL,7,FBID has organised a giant wheel and    
OL,8,Ftraditional carousel, which will be    
OL,9,Favailable until 23 December.           
